_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fv0X48d0EHcQ7kNvwF1yIOw&_nc_oc=AdrdAjpaTWr0Cu8SDRujynZ1hPJn7eer_q2pX5AbvwuPUgZ1NK4FXFkeqpCW1GlWWP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMRbfAJCx69BQ0b4zsplySEQh6VUwQv_pufpkDLBU1eg&oe=6AE5F336"}, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["twilight", "horror", "puzzles", "shooter", "adventure"], "long_description": "We invite you to face your fears in a disturbing and mind-bending series of adventures... all taking place within Tales from the Zone\u2122. This game features elements of stealth, escape mechanics and narrative twists.  Unlock secrets to enable new modes!\n\n{740987448165854}\n\nStory 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - A video game director discovers that workplace cruelty is a dangerous game.  \n\nStory 2: TERROR FIRMA - After an environmental apocalypse, one survivor must fight mysterious phantoms as he searches the city ruins for a glimmer of Hope. \n\nStory 3: DEADLINE EARTH - The clock is ticking for a science fiction writer who finds himself captive on an insidious alien vessel.  What are their true intentions?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "You will be traveling through another dimension. Prepare your mind, body and soul.  You are invited to enter\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122. \n\nThe producers that brought you the horror hit Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) now present a new mind-bending anthology game featuring interwoven tales of science fiction, horror and mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1921888035186136", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["crep\u00fasculo", "terror", "rompecabezas", "disparos", "aventura"], "long_description": "Te invitamos a enfrentarte a tus miedos en una inquietante y desconcertante serie de aventuras... todo dentro de Tales from the Zone\u2122. El juego incluye elementos de sigilo, mec\u00e1nicas de escape y giros narrativos. \u00a1Desbloquea secretos para habilitar nuevos modos!\n\n{740987448165854}\n\nHistoria 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - Un director de videojuegos descubre que la crueldad en el trabajo es un juego peligroso.\n\nHistoria 2: TERROR FIRMA - Tras un apocalipsis medioambiental, un superviviente debe luchar contra misteriosos fantasmas mientras busca un resquicio de Esperanza entre las ruinas de la ciudad.\n\nHistoria 3: DEADLINE EARTH - El tiempo corre para un escritor de ciencia ficci\u00f3n que se encuentra prisionero en una insidiosa nave alien\u00edgena. \u00bfCu\u00e1les son sus verdaderas intenciones?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "Viajar\u00e1s a otra dimensi\u00f3n. Prepara tu mente, tu cuerpo y tu alma. Te invitamos a entrar en\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122.\n\nLos productores que te trajeron el \u00e9xito de terror Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) presentan ahora un nuevo y alucinante juego antol\u00f3gico de relatos entrelazados de ciencia ficci\u00f3n, terror y misterio."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1833750717756953", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["D\u00e4mmerung", "Horror", "R\u00e4tsel", "Shooter", "Abenteuer"], "long_description": "Stelle dich deinen \u00c4ngsten in einer verst\u00f6renden Reihe von Abenteuern, die den Verstand verbiegen... alle in Tales from the Zone\u2122. Mit Stealth-Elementen, Fluchtmechaniken und \u00fcberraschenden Wendungen der Geschichte. Schalte Geheimnisse frei und aktiviere neue Modi!\n\n{740987448165854}\n\nStory 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - Ein Videospielregisseur entdeckt, dass Grausamkeit am Arbeitsplatz ein gef\u00e4hrliches Spiel ist.\n\nStory 2: TERROR FIRMA - Nach einer Umweltapokalypse muss ein \u00dcberlebender geheimnisvolle Phantome bek\u00e4mpfen, w\u00e4hrend er in den Ruinen der Stadt nach einem Funken Hoffnung sucht.\n\nStory 3: DEADLINE EARTH - Die Uhr tickt f\u00fcr einen Science-Fiction-Autor, der sich als Gefangener auf einem heimt\u00fcckischen Alien-Schiff wiederfindet. Was sind ihre wahren Absichten?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "Du wirst in eine andere Dimension reisen. Bereite Geist, K\u00f6rper und Seele vor. Du bist eingeladen, einzutreten in\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122.\n\nDie Macher des Horrorhits Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) pr\u00e4sentieren ein neues, fesselndes Anthologiespiel mit verwobenen Geschichten aus Science-Fiction, Horror und Mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1759067389282335", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["cr\u00e9puscule", "horreur", "puzzle", "tir", "aventure"], "long_description": "Affrontez vos peurs dans une s\u00e9rie d'aventures troublantes et hallucinantes... le tout dans Tales from the Zone\u2122. Infiltration, m\u00e9caniques d'\u00e9vasion et rebondissements narratifs sont au rendez-vous. D\u00e9bloquez des secrets pour activer de nouveaux modes !\n\n{740987448165854}\n\nHistoire 1 : CHARACTER BUILDING - Un directeur de jeu vid\u00e9o d\u00e9couvre que la cruaut\u00e9 au travail est un jeu dangereux.\n\nHistoire 2 : TERROR FIRMA - Apr\u00e8s une apocalypse environnementale, un survivant affronte de myst\u00e9rieux fant\u00f4mes en cherchant une lueur d'espoir dans les ruines de la ville.\n\nHistoire 3 : DEADLINE EARTH - Le temps presse pour un \u00e9crivain de science-fiction retenu captif dans un vaisseau alien insidieux. Quelles sont leurs v\u00e9ritables intentions ?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "Vous allez voyager dans une autre dimension. Pr\u00e9parez votre esprit, votre corps et votre \u00e2me. Vous \u00eates invit\u00e9 \u00e0 entrer dans\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122.\n\nLes producteurs du succ\u00e8s horrifique Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) pr\u00e9sentent un nouveau jeu d'anthologie hallucinant, compos\u00e9 de r\u00e9cits entrelac\u00e9s de science-fiction, d'horreur et de myst\u00e8re."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1754182755646043", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["\ud669\ud63c", "\ud638\ub7ec", "\ud37c\uc990", "\uc288\ud130", "\uc5b4\ub4dc\ubca4\ucc98"], "long_description": "\ubd88\uc548\ud558\uace0\ub3c4 \ub180\ub77c\uc6b4 \ubaa8\ud5d8\uc758 \uc5f0\uc18d \uc18d\uc5d0\uc11c \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ub450\ub824\uc6c0\uacfc \ub9c8\uc8fc\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uadf8 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc774\uc57c\uae30\uac00 Tales from the Zone\u2122 \uc548\uc5d0\uc11c \ud3bc\uccd0\uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774 \uac8c\uc784\uc740 \uc7a0\uc785 \uc694\uc18c\uc640 \ud0c8\ucd9c \uba54\ucee4\ub2c8\uc998, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 \ubc18\uc804\uc774 \uc788\ub294 \uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac\ub97c \ub2f4\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ube44\ubc00\uc744 \ud480\uc5b4 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ubaa8\ub4dc\ub97c \ud574\uc81c\ud558\uc138\uc694!\n\n{740987448165854}\n\n\uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - \ud55c \ube44\ub514\uc624 \uac8c\uc784 \ub514\ub809\ud130\uac00 \uc9c1\uc7a5\uc5d0\uc11c\uc758 \uc794\ud639\ud568\uc774 \uc704\ud5d8\ud55c \uac8c\uc784\uc784\uc744 \uae68\ub2eb\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac 2: TERROR FIRMA - \ud658\uacbd \uc7ac\uc559 \uc774\ud6c4, \ud55c \uc0dd\uc874\uc790\uac00 \ub3c4\uc2dc\uc758 \ud3d0\ud5c8\uc5d0\uc11c \ud76c\ub9dd\uc758 \ube5b\uc744 \ucc3e\uc544\ub2e4\ub2c8\uba70 \uc218\uc218\uaed8\ub07c\uc758 \uc720\ub839\ub4e4\uacfc \ub9de\uc11c \uc2f8\uc6cc\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac 3: DEADLINE EARTH - \ud55c SF \uc791\uac00\uac00 \uc74c\ud749\ud55c \uc678\uacc4 \uc6b0\uc8fc\uc120\uc5d0 \ubd99\uc7a1\ud78c \uac00\uc6b4\ub370 \uc2dc\uac04\uc740 \uacc4\uc18d \ud758\ub7ec\uac11\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub4e4\uc758 \uc9c4\uc9dc \uc758\ub3c4\ub294 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc77c\uae4c\uc694?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ub610 \ub2e4\ub978 \ucc28\uc6d0\uc73c\ub85c \uc5ec\ud589\uc744 \ub5a0\ub098\uac8c \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9c8\uc74c\uacfc \ubab8, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 \uc601\ud63c\uc744 \uc900\ube44\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc744 \ucd08\ub300\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122\uc758 \uc138\uacc4\ub85c.\n\n\ud638\ub7ec \ud788\ud2b8\uc791 Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)\uc758 \uc81c\uc791\uc9c4\uc774 \uc120\ubcf4\uc774\ub294, SF\uc640 \ud638\ub7ec, \ubbf8\uc2a4\ud130\ub9ac\uac00 \uc5bd\ud78c \uc774\uc57c\uae30\ub4e4\uc744 \ub2f4\uc740 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc564\uc194\ub7ec\uc9c0 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1624237932770052", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales from the Zone\u2122", "keywords": ["crep\u00fasculo", "terror", "rompecabezas", "disparos", "aventura"], "long_description": "Te invitamos a enfrentarte a tus miedos en una inquietante y desconcertante serie de aventuras... todo dentro de Tales from the Zone\u2122. El juego incluye elementos de sigilo, mec\u00e1nicas de escape y giros narrativos. \u00a1Desbloquea secretos para habilitar nuevos modos!\n\n{740987448165854}\n\nHistoria 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - Un director de videojuegos descubre que la crueldad en el trabajo es un juego peligroso.\n\nHistoria 2: TERROR FIRMA - Tras un apocalipsis medioambiental, un superviviente debe luchar contra misteriosos fantasmas mientras busca un resquicio de Esperanza entre las ruinas de la ciudad.\n\nHistoria 3: DEADLINE EARTH - El tiempo corre para un escritor de ciencia ficci\u00f3n que se encuentra prisionero en una insidiosa nave alien\u00edgena. \u00bfCu\u00e1les son sus verdaderas intenciones?\n\n{2896850753787574}\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2026 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\nhttps://www.funtrainvr.com/talesfromthezone", "short_description": "Viajar\u00e1s a otra dimensi\u00f3n. Prepara tu mente, tu cuerpo y tu alma. Te invitamos a entrar en\u2026 Tales from the Zone\u2122.\n\nLos productores que te trajeron el \u00e9xito de terror Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) presentan ahora un nuevo y alucinante juego antol\u00f3gico de relatos entrelazados de ciencia ficci\u00f3n, terror y misterio."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.funtrainvr.com/twilightzonevr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.funtrainvr.com/twilightzonevr-eula", "publisher_name": "Fun Train", "support_website_url": "https://www.funtrainvr.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.funtrainvr.com/the-twilight-zone", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["HORROR"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking